description:
A Dungeon Loop Top Down 2D Shooter where you go from room to room battling enemies to escape the dungeon after killing the Boss.

Please comment if you liked the game or have any feedback!

You can also check the game source code : https://github.com/Medamine-Bahassou/Unity-Project-Procedural-Map-Generation-PathFinding

Default keyboard & mouse controls:

[WASD] - Movement;
[Space] - Algorithms Panel;
[Shift] - Sprint / Dash;
[N] - Collecte Coins dynamically;
[B] - Open chest;
[Escape] - Pause Panel;
[E] - Zoom ( out / in ) the minimap;

[Left Mouse Button] - Fire;
